{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15276","headline":"冬夜与故友聚送吉校书 · 李端","name":"冬夜与故友聚送吉校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"途穷别则怨，何必天涯去。\n共作出门人，不见归乡路。\n殷勤执杯酒，怅望送亲故。\n月色入闲轩，风声落高树。\n云霄望且远，齿发行应暮。\n九日泣黄花，三秋悲白露。\n君行过洛阳，莫向青山度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}